      :intent "Codify persistent launchd/systemd daemon supervisor, central AntiGravity session hub routing, cross-project mutex leases, and distributed peer mesh"
      :outcome "Seamless multi-project orchestration, elimination of socket permission errors and netcat freezes, and autonomous cross-machine federation"
      :whyNot ("On-demand shell spawning causes sandbox quarantine and permission collisions, and lack of cross-project buffer mutexes causes multi-agent write collisions")
      :adr ".asl/mem/decisions/D65MultiProjectOrchestrationDaemonLaunchStrategyAndMeshNetwork.asn"
      :tasks ["T420DaemonLaunchSupervisor" "T420CentralHubRouting" "T420CrossProjectMutexRegistry" "T420DistributedMeshTopology" "T420NonBlockingSocketClient" "T420Settle"]
