      :outcome "Crystal-clear visibility into macro architectural evolution, continuous self-healing pruning of tech debt, and verifiable physical 4-tier receipts"
      :whyNot ("Granular task ledgers drown high-level intent in noise, absence of retrospectives allows cruft to harden, and synthetic APM metrics lack grounding")
