      :intent "Establish 3-tier memory topology authorizing package-level memory stores, reserving root repo memory for invariants, and isolating transient runtime caches"
      :outcome "Eliminates root task pollution, enables collision-free concurrent package development, and protects long-term architectural ground truth"
      :whyNot ("Monolithic memory causes cognitive sprawl, git merge conflicts across agents, and conflates permanent truth with transient caches")
      :adr ".asl/mem/decisions/D68HierarchicalMemoryScopingPackageRepoWorkspaceTopology.asn"
