      :intent "Institutionalize audit findings into permanent paradigm axioms, define strict binary whitelist in .asl.config.asn, and enforce static anomaly detection"
      :outcome "Mathematically prevents regression of past audit issues, statically eliminates rogue third-party binaries, and provides 100 percent dependency provenance"
      :whyNot ("Treating audit anomalies as isolated fixes allows identical defects to recur in downstream projects, and unverified tools silently contaminate builds")
