      :sym "architecture/universal-mvcc-semantic-merge"
      :title "Universal MVCC, Software Transactional Memory, and Homoiconic Semantic 3-Way Merge Engine"
      :intent "Establish universal multi-version concurrency control, multi-file software transactional memory, causal message DAGs, and homoiconic AST 3-way merge across files, agent bus, task execution, prompt trees, and speculative fuzzing"
      :outcome "Lock-free multi-agent parallel workspace editing, atomic multi-buffer commits, branching causal event bus, >85% prompt token sharing via radix prefix trees, and resident in-memory mutation fuzzing"
